    "Data structures and interfaces": "classDiagram\n    class Player {\n        <<enum>>\n        +X\n        +O\n        +next() Player\n        +toString() String\n    }\n    class Move {\n        -int row\n        -int col\n        -Player player\n        -int index\n        +Move(int row, int col, Player player, int index)\n        +getRow() int\n        +getCol() int\n        +getPlayer() Player\n        +getIndex() int\n        +equals(Object) boolean\n        +hashCode() int\n        +toString() String\n    }\n    class GameState {\n        <<value>>\n        +Status status\n        +Optional~Player~ getWinner()\n        +inProgress() GameState\n        +draw() GameState\n        +won(Player) GameState\n        enum Status { IN_PROGRESS, DRAW, X_WON, O_WON }\n    }\n    class Board {\n        -int size\n        -Player[][] grid\n        +Board(int size)\n        +getSize() int\n        +isInBounds(int,int) boolean\n        +getCell(int,int) Player\n        +isEmpty(int,int) boolean\n        +setCell(int,int,Player) boolean\n        +clearCell(int,int) void\n        +snapshot() Player[][]\n    }\n    class WinDetector {\n        +hasFiveInRow(Board,int,int,Player) boolean\n    }\n    class Game {\n        -Board board\n        -Player currentPlayer\n        -GameState state\n        -java.util.List~Move~ history\n        +Game(int size)\n        +getBoard() Board\n        +getCurrentPlayer() Player\n        +getState() GameState\n        +placeMove(int,int) boolean\n        +undo() boolean\n        +reset() void\n        +getHistory() java.util.List~Move~\n    }\n    class Main {\n        +main(String[] args) void\n    }\n    Game --> Board\n    Game --> Player\n    Game --> GameState\n    Game --> Move\n    Game --> WinDetector\n    Main --> Game",
    "Program call flow": "sequenceDiagram\n    participant M as Main\n    participant G as Game\n    participant B as Board\n    participant WD as WinDetector\n    M->>G: new Game(15)\n    G->>B: allocate Board(15)\n    G-->>M: Game ready (currentPlayer=X, IN_PROGRESS)\n    M->>G: placeMove(1,1)\n    G->>B: setCell(1,1,X)\n    G->>WD: hasFiveInRow(B,1,1,X)?\n    WD-->>G: false\n    G-->>M: true (currentPlayer becomes O)\n    M->>G: placeMove(2,2)\n    G->>B: setCell(2,2,O)\n    G->>WD: hasFiveInRow(B,2,2,O)?\n    WD-->>G: false\n    G-->>M: true (currentPlayer becomes X)\n    M-->>M: print \"Caro core ready\" and return",
